0..75 Comment "// What forgetting a manifest carrier refuses: a model of a theory with the"
76..152 Comment "// counter\'s carrier but not its reading is no counter once forgotten, and a"
153..218 Comment "// model fixing one sort is no model fixing another. Two counters"
219..293 Comment "// whose carriers are not shared do not mix, and a counter has no sort but"
294..360 Comment "// its carrier. A pairing whose second carrier is its own does not"
361..428 Comment "// share another\'s. A counter\'s operation read off its binder steps"
429..506 Comment "// only that counter\'s counts, and a counter has no operation but its own and"
507..547 Comment "// no field at a carrier its type fixes."
548..622 Comment "// `../../model/identity/model-counter-manifest.gandr` forgets a counter\'s"
623..698 Comment "// manifest carrier, a counter\'s manifest readings alone, and a carrier two"
699..775 Comment "// counters share, or two pairings fixing their first, and reads a counter\'s"
776..805 Comment "// operations off its binder."
806..808 Comment "//"
809..824 Comment "// - see: #2132"
825..873 Comment "// - see: #2131 — `unshared`, `integersShared`"
874..906 Comment "// - see: #2158 — `rightApart`"
907..972 Comment "// - see: #2246 — `stepApart`, `stepOfNothing`, `stepOfCarrier`"
974..1029 Comment "// The counter, and `observe`, which reads any counter."
1030..1036 Keyword "import"
1037..1038 StringLit "\""
1038..1078 StringLit "../../model/identity/model-counter.gandr"
1078..1079 StringLit "\""
